1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,350
Tell me about a time you worked in a team.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,520
Most people say: “We did a group project, and it went pretty well.”

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,670
That tells them nothing.

4
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:13,150
Use the STAR method instead.

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:17,259
S is for Situation. Set the scene in one sentence.

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:22,571
T is for Task. What were you responsible for?

7
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:29,486
A is for Action. What did you do? This is the longest part.

8
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:34,852
R is for Result. End on a number, or a lesson.

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,533
Keep it under a minute. Spend half of it on Action.

10
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:48,150
Every common question, broken down. Get the Offer. Link in bio.
